[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769044017","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104858#issuecomment-2769044017","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104858","id":2769044017,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lDEIx","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T11:25:36Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T11:27:49Z","body":"It works correctly if you enable `backface_collision` in the shape, and `hit_back_faces` in the params, it doesn't support this by default and you can't hit a face that doesn't exist in this case, in fact the `hit_from_inside` property is irrelevant for concave shapes (see the documentation for details)\n\nThis should be better documented if it isn't already","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769044017/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769709666","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104858#issuecomment-2769709666","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104858","id":2769709666,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lFmpi","user":{"login":"Helpsypoo","id":3430112,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MzAxMTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3430112?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo","html_url":"https://github.com/Helpsypoo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Helpsypoo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T15:13:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T15:13:09Z","body":"I see, thanks. I'll say a bit more about my confusion, in case it's helpful for making docs decisions.\n\nThe main source of my confusion was that the Trimesh option in the CreateCollisionShape module produces a ConcavePolygonShape3D, even if the shape itself is mathematically convex. It makes perfect sense now that this would be the case, but I had implicitly assumed otherwise.\n\nI had also assumed that hit_from_inside would allow hitting a face from the wrong side (the inside!) rather than reporting a hit immediately if the ray originates inside a convex shape. Now that I've tried swapping the collision shape for an actual convex one, I see that the collision is detected at the origin of the ray when the shape overlaps with it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769709666/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]